{"meta": {"family": "multicol"}, "regions": [{"id": "multicol-0/title", "bbox": [40.0, 24.0, 984.0, 64.0], "text": "Controller Family Hardware Specification - Chapter 4", "role": "title", "parent": null, "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-0/col0", "bbox": [40.0, 90.0, 497.0, 1000.0], "text": "", "role": "container", "parent": null, "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-0/s1h", "bbox": [40.0, 90.0, 497.0, 118.0], "text": "4.1 RF-3 Thermal Management", "role": "heading", "parent": "multicol-0/col0", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-0/s1p", "bbox": [40.0, 122.0, 497.0, 194.0], "text": "The RF-3 thermal shutdown threshold is 74 C; fan speed ramps linearly from 82 C.", "role": "text", "parent": "multicol-0/col0", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-0/s2h", "bbox": [40.0, 220.0, 497.0, 248.0], "text": "4.2 RF-3 Bus Interface", "role": "heading", "parent": "multicol-0/col0", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-0/s2p", "bbox": [40.0, 252.0, 497.0, 324.0], "text": "The RF-3 SPI bus clock is limited to 75 MHz; CRC errors above 30 per hour raise a fault.", "role": "text", "parent": "multicol-0/col0", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-0/s3h", "bbox": [40.0, 350.0, 497.0, 378.0], "text": "4.3 RF-3 Watchdog Timer", "role": "heading", "parent": "multicol-0/col0", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-0/s3p", "bbox": [40.0, 382.0, 497.0, 454.0], "text": "The RF-3 watchdog timeout is 98 ms; the window opens after 40 ms and a missed kick forces reset.", "role": "text", "parent": "multicol-0/col0", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-0/s4h", "bbox": [40.0, 480.0, 497.0, 508.0], "text": "4.4 RF-3 Calibration", "role": "heading", "parent": "multicol-0/col0", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-0/s4p", "bbox": [40.0, 512.0, 497.0, 584.0], "text": "Factory calibration of the RF-3 stores 67 coefficients; drift beyond 70 ppm requires recalibration.", "role": "text", "parent": "multicol-0/col0", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-0/col1", "bbox": [527.0, 90.0, 984.0, 1000.0], "text": "", "role": "container", "parent": null, "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-0/s5h", "bbox": [527.0, 90.0, 984.0, 118.0], "text": "4.5 TC-4 Calibration", "role": "heading", "parent": "multicol-0/col1", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-0/s5p", "bbox": [527.0, 122.0, 984.0, 194.0], "text": "Factory calibration of the TC-4 stores 76 coefficients; drift beyond 38 ppm requires recalibration.", "role": "text", "parent": "multicol-0/col1", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-0/s6h", "bbox": [527.0, 220.0, 984.0, 248.0], "text": "4.6 TC-4 Bus Interface", "role": "heading", "parent": "multicol-0/col1", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-0/s6p", "bbox": [527.0, 252.0, 984.0, 324.0], "text": "The TC-4 SPI bus clock is limited to 81 MHz; CRC errors above 30 per hour raise a fault.", "role": "text", "parent": "multicol-0/col1", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-0/s7h", "bbox": [527.0, 350.0, 984.0, 378.0], "text": "4.7 TC-4 Power Sequencing", "role": "heading", "parent": "multicol-0/col1", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-0/s7p", "bbox": [527.0, 382.0, 984.0, 454.0], "text": "Rails of the TC-4 power up in order 3V3, 1V8, 0V9 with 117 ms spacing; brownout trips at 62 mV.", "role": "text", "parent": "multicol-0/col1", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-0/s8h", "bbox": [527.0, 480.0, 984.0, 508.0], "text": "4.8 TC-4 Watchdog Timer", "role": "heading", "parent": "multicol-0/col1", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-0/s8p", "bbox": [527.0, 512.0, 984.0, 584.0], "text": "The TC-4 watchdog timeout is 27 ms; the window opens after 58 ms and a missed kick forces reset.", "role": "text", "parent": "multicol-0/col1", "links": []}]}